+## Overview
+
+Across 30 orders, total revenue reached $7,154.44. The median order value was $204.94, indicating a wide spread between small and large orders. Four products sold across four regions during the reporting period.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget led with $2,392.00 in revenue, followed closely by Widget at $2,118.94. Doohickey contributed $1,513.00, while Sprocket trailed at $1,130.50. Together, Gadget and Widget account for roughly 63% of total revenue, so both are central to overall performance.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North was the strongest region at $2,176.35, followed by East at $1,830.79 and South at $1,732.48. West lagged at $1,414.82. The gap between North and West is $761.53, showing meaningful regional variation despite a similar product mix.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget and Widget inventory and promotion; together they drive about 63% of revenue and anchor the catalog.
+- Investigate why West trails North by $761.53, then apply North's winning tactics to lift underperforming regions.
+- Support Sprocket, the lowest-revenue product at $1,130.50, with pricing or bundling tests to raise its contribution.
